 "body": {
  "model": "openai/text-embedding-3-small",
  "input": "Which note first recorded that the scheduler depends on feature-flags, and when?\n[2025-03-28] standup/ember/2025-03-28: If feature-flags is down, the job scheduler is down: it relies on it for per-job kill switches. [2025-10-21] standup/atlas/2025-10-21: New dependency for the billing service: the feature flag service. Billing-api will gate the new invoice flow behind feature-flags; the reasoning is that the rollout needs a per-tenant kill switch. [2025-08-20] standup/cinder/2025-08-20: Decision: clients will cache feature-flags evaluations for 30 seconds, because feature-flags saw 40,000 requests per second at peak and most of them were identical. Cinder noticed that the reporting service's p99 latency doubled after Tuesday's deploy and pinged the owners.",
  "dimensions": 1536
 },
